        <dc:title>Furry Zombies</dc:title>
        <dc:creator opf:file-as="Handrahan, John" opf:role="aut">Handrahan, John</dc:creator>
        <dc:contributor opf:file-as="calibre" opf:role="bkp">calibre (3.42.0) [https://calibre-ebook.com]</dc:contributor>
        <dc:date>2013-06-05T04:00:00+00:00</dc:date>
        <dc:description>&lt;p class="description"&gt;Furry zombie book. This story spins a tale from the furry side of the undead. A secretive unknown evil is lurking to greet a small team of cable workers who will fight fur and feather to escape from a small Scottish island to the safety of the mainland.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Scientists’ best guess on how many species of animals live on this planet is between 3 million and 30 million. That’s a lot of ways to die in my Furry zombie book. This story spins a tale from the furry side of the undead. A secretive unknown evil is lurking to greet a small team of cable workers who will fight fur and feather to escape from a small Scottish island to the safety of the mainland. This is the story of first contact with Furry Zombies, love, honour, mans struggle with the wilderness and finding new and previously unknown and sometimes plainly ridiculous methods to slay zombies.Some animal were killed in the writing of this book&lt;/p&gt;</dc:description>
